Compensation & Classification Employee Holiday Schedule Employment Verification Employee Wellness Exiting Employment Faculty Resources Leave Lumberjack Education Assistance Program Military Employment Preference Information Public Service Loan Forgiveness Program As a university, we understand the importance in supporting our faculty in their commitment to excellence in teaching, research, and service and in their endeavors to create transformative experiences for students through high-impact, participatory learning approaches. Below are some of the resources available to our faculty. General Resources Department of Academic Affairs New Faculty Orientation Handbook University Policies - Academics (Faculty) Teaching and Research Center for Teaching & Learning Office of Grants & Sponsored Programs Ralph W. Steen Library Registrar's Office Faculty Awards and Honors Teaching Excellence Awards Regents Scholar Governance Academic Affairs Committees Affordable Care Act Benefits Annual Enrollment Insurance Retirement Compensation & Classification Employee Holiday Schedule Employment Verification Employee Wellness Exiting Employment Faculty Resources Leave Lumberjack Education Assistance Program Military Employment Preference Information Public Service Loan Forgiveness Program Internal job opportunities for current SFA employees View positions Contact: Human Resources 936.468.2304 Fax: 800.435.3919 hr@sfasu.edu Physical Address: 1936 North Street Austin Building Room 201 Mailing Address: Box 13039 SFA Station Nacogdoches, TX 75962 Can we help you find what you’re looking for? Request Info Visit Contact Us Contact or visit us: 936.468.4SFA (4732) Email Us 1936 North St. Nacogdoches, Texas SFA Homepage Request Info Visit Apply Give Public Course Information and Instructor CVs Faculty and Staff Directory Campus Map Accreditations Licensure and Certification Preparation Programs A-Z List Current Weather Conditions Electronic Accessibility | Nondiscrimination and Title IX | Menta